<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-feral-druid-dps">Rings for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Your best two rings are going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67136/gilnean-ring-of-ruination">
<img alt="Gilnean Ring of Ruination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_emeraldstonering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gilnean Ring of Ruination</span></a> which is an epic world drop, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a> which is earned through exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1135/the-earthen-ring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Earthen Ring</span></a>. As <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67136/gilnean-ring-of-ruination">
<img alt="Gilnean Ring of Ruination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_emeraldstonering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gilnean Ring of Ruination</span></a> will likely be very expensive during the first tier of Cataclysm you can also look for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56282/nautilus-ring">
<img alt="Nautilus Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_shell_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nautilus Ring</span></a> which drops from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5004/throne-of-the-tides">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of the Tides</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
