<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-feral-druid-dps">Trinkets for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Feral Druid DPS loves Agility so any trinkets that provide agility are going to be your strongest. The best that are available pre-raid are going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62468/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
