<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-feral-druid-dps">Two handed Weapons for Feral Druid DPS</h4>There are a few options for Pre-Raid Feral Druid DPS weapons. Any of the 2handers that provide agility and are 346 item level are very close to one another with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55066/elementium-poleaxe">
<img alt="Elementium Poleaxe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Poleaxe</span></a> slightly edging out the competition.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=95471/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a>
